How to Run the Project
If you have Python Run in Python Software (like IDLE or VS Code)
1. Save the code above as car_counter.py
2. Make sure highway.mp4 is in the same folder (or change the path)
3. Open your terminal or Python IDE
4. Run:
python car_counter.py

If You have Jupiter Notebook Run in Jupyter Notebook

1. Open Jupyter Notebook:
jupyter notebook
2. Create a new notebook (Python 3)
3. Paste the code in a cell (you might need to add !pip install opencv-python first)
4. Run the cell

Note Jupyter sometimes has issues with cv2.imshow(). To avoid this, you can display frames inside the notebook using IPython.display if needed. Let me know if you want that version!

